From: "Barak A. Pearlmutter" <barak+git@pearlmutter.net>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 15:00:00 +0100
Subject: port to Qt 6 and poppler-qt6

Based on the Qt 6 port on https://github.com/barak/diffpdf branch main
and the Qt 6 / modern Poppler macOS port disparPDF
(https://github.com/yuw/ConfrontaPDF), with these corrections:

 - getTextBoxes() wrapped each Poppler::TextBox in a QSharedPointer while
   the std::unique_ptr returned by Page::textList() still owned it, a
   double free; take ownership with release() instead.
 - Poppler::Page objects are owned via QSharedPointer as before, rather
   than released into raw pointers and leaked.
 - Install translators only if they load ([[nodiscard]] in Qt 6).

Other changes: QRegExp -> QRegularExpression, QTime -> QElapsedTimer,
QPrinter::setOrientation -> setPageOrientation, QLabel::pixmap() returns
by value, qSort -> std::sort, QMap::insertMulti -> QMultiMap::insert,
QTextStream is UTF-8 by default and <defaultcodec> is gone from .ts
files, QLibraryInfo::location -> path, PagePair must be assignable to be
held in a QVariant, and QString::arg() no longer takes char16_t.

Forwarded: no
